<title>UK: BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of finals at the world badminton championships on Sunday (prefix numbers denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p> 15-Peter Rasmussen (Denmark) beat 3-Sun Jun (China) 16-17 18-13 15-10  </p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>1-Ye Zhaoying (China) beat 2-Gong Zhichao (China) 12-11 11-8</p>
</text>
